title: ediarum.platform
abstract: "ediarum.platform is the single browser entry point for the ediarum services: it provides login, profile and a shared top menu, and mounts the frontends of ediarum apps such as ediarum.WEBDAV and ediarum.zotero at runtime."
type: software
